---
// Terms of use. Company facts come from site.ts; an empty value renders nothing.
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';

const toc = [
  { id: 'using-this-site', title: 'Using this site' },
  { id: 'intellectual-property', title: 'Intellectual property and copyright' },
  { id: 'no-professional-advice', title: 'No professional advice' },
  { id: 'accuracy', title: 'Accuracy and availability' },
  { id: 'links', title: 'Links to other sites' },
  { id: 'liability', title: 'Liability' },
  { id: 'governing-law', title: 'Governing law' },
  { id: 'changes', title: 'Changes' },
  { id: 'contact', title: 'Contact' },
];

const domain = site.url.replace('https://', '');
const company =
  `${site.legalName}, a company registered in ${site.country}` +
  (site.croNumber ? ` under company number ${site.croNumber}` : '') +
  (site.registeredOffice ? `, with its registered office at ${site.registeredOffice}` : '');
---

<Legal
  title="Terms of use: Viaclin"
  description="The terms for using viaclin.com: acceptable use, copyright and intellectual property, no professional advice, liability and the governing law of Ireland."
  lead="The terms that apply when you use this website. Client engagements run under their own signed contract."
  path="/terms"
  toc={toc}
>
  <h2 id="using-this-site">Using this site</h2>
  <p>
    {domain} is operated by {company}. In these terms, "Viaclin", "we" and "us" mean that company.
  </p>
  <p>By using the site you accept these terms. If you do not accept them, stop using the site.</p>
  <p>You may use the site for any lawful purpose. You must not:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>try to gain access to the site, its server or any connected system without permission</li>
    <li>introduce malicious code, or attack the site in any other way</li>
    <li>copy the site in bulk with automated tools in a way that harms its operation</li>
    <li>use the contact form to send unsolicited marketing, or pretend to be someone else when you write to us</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    The <a href="/privacy">privacy notice</a> and the <a href="/cookies">cookie policy</a> explain how we handle data.
    Both form part of these terms.
  </p>

  <h2 id="intellectual-property">Intellectual property and copyright</h2>
  <p>
    The content of this site, including the text, design, diagrams, logo, footage and code, belongs
    to {site.legalName} or to its licensors. Copyright and other intellectual property laws protect it. All rights
    are reserved.
  </p>
  <p>
    The Viaclin name, the V mark and the wordmark identify {site.legalName}. Use them to refer to us and for nothing
    else, unless we agree in writing.
  </p>
  <p>
    Third-party names and logos shown on the site belong to their owners. The
    {' '}<a href="/legal#trademarks">trademark notice</a> explains why they appear.
  </p>
  <p>
    You are welcome to view and print pages for your own use, to share links, and to quote short passages with a credit
    to Viaclin and a link to the source page. Anything beyond that, such as republishing whole pages or reusing the
    footage, needs our written permission first.
  </p>

  <h2 id="no-professional-advice">No professional advice</h2>
  <p>
    The content of this site is general information about our services and about life sciences supply chains. It is
    not regulatory, quality, legal or medical advice, and it takes no account of your circumstances. Do not act on it
    without advice that fits your situation.
  </p>
  <p>
    Nothing on this site is an offer open to acceptance, and nothing here forms part of a contract. An engagement with
    Viaclin is governed by the signed contract for that engagement and by nothing else.
  </p>
  <p>
    The site is written for people who work in life sciences companies. It promotes no medicinal product and is not
    aimed at patients. If you have a question about a medicine or about your health, speak to a doctor or a pharmacist.
  </p>

  <h2 id="accuracy">Accuracy and availability</h2>
  <p>
    We take care to keep the site accurate and up to date. We do not promise that every page is complete, current or
    free of error, and we may change or remove content without notice.
  </p>
  <p>
    We do not promise that the site will be available at all times or free of interruption. We may suspend or withdraw
    it, in whole or in part, for maintenance or for any business reason.
  </p>
  <p>We take steps to keep the site secure. Protecting your own device with up-to-date software is your responsibility.</p>

  <h2 id="links">Links to other sites</h2>
  <p>
    Where the site links to another website, the link is there for information. We do not control those sites, we have
    not checked everything on them, and a link is not an endorsement. Their own terms and privacy notices apply once
    you leave.
  </p>
  <p>
    You may link to any page of this site, provided the link is fair and does not suggest that we endorse you, or that
    we are connected to you, where that is not the case.
  </p>

  <h2 id="liability">Liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the extent the law allows, {site.legalName} excludes all conditions, warranties and representations that might
    otherwise apply to this site or its content, whether express or implied.
  </p>
  <p>
    To the same extent, we are not liable for any loss or damage that arises from the use of this site, from being
    unable to use it, or from depending on its content. That includes loss of profit, revenue, business, data or
    goodwill, and any indirect or consequential loss.
  </p>
  <p>
    Nothing in these terms limits or excludes liability that cannot be limited or excluded under the law
    of {site.country}, including liability for death or personal injury caused by negligence and liability for fraud.
    If you use the site as a consumer, your statutory rights are not affected.
  </p>

  <h2 id="governing-law">Governing law</h2>
  <p>
    These terms, and any dispute or claim that arises from them or from the use of this site, are governed by the laws
    of {site.country}. The courts of {site.country} have exclusive jurisdiction.
  </p>
  <p>If any part of these terms is found to be unenforceable, the rest stays in force.</p>

  <h2 id="changes">Changes</h2>
  <p>
    We may revise these terms. The date at the top of the page shows when the text last changed, and the version on
    this page is the one that applies to your visit.
  </p>

  <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
  <p>
    {site.legalName}, registered in {site.country}{site.croNumber && `, company number ${site.croNumber}`}.
    {site.registeredOffice && ` Registered office: ${site.registeredOffice}.`}
    {` VAT number ${site.vat}.`}
  </p>
  <p>Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></p>
</Legal>
